e  with parents who push them in a  direction that's more comfortable  or practical if you're listening I hope  you realize that you're not alone as  much as we love and respect our  Guardians they don't always know what's  best for us your life is your own and  you deserve to eventually look back at  your life knowing you lived it the way  you wanted to  I feel more driven and fulfilled than I  ever could be as a programmer now that  I'm living my life so truthfully who is  by no means easy to get here but I have  faith that you can do it too  [Music]
 

